        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tryon D. Lewis\n- Places: Odessa, Texas; Ector County; Midland County; Andrews County; Winkler County\n- Organizations: Texas House of Representatives\n- Roles: attorney; Republican state representative\n\nFacts:\n- Tryon Dexter Lewis was born on September 29, 1947.\n- Tryon Dexter Lewis is an attorney in Odessa, Texas.\n- Tryon Dexter Lewis is a Republican former member of the Texas House of Representatives from District 81.\n- Texas House of Representatives District 81 includes Ector, Andrews, and Winkler counties.\n- Odessa, Texas is located primarily in Ector County.\n- A small portion of Odessa, Texas extends into Midland County.",
